{"title":"Vintage Tourist Maps of Japan","link":"https://kottke.org/26/01/vintage-tourist-maps-of-japan","date":1769635625000,"content":"\n         <img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48258-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48258-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48258-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1500\" />\n\n<img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48258-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48258-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48258-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1001\" />\n\n<img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48258-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48258-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none//images/posts/01/img-48258-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2000\" height=\"1500\" />\n\nThe gang at Present &amp; Correct found <a href=\"https://www.presentandcorrect.com/blogs/blog/paper-trails\">a cache of pre-war tourist maps of Japan</a> while rummaging around in Tokyo’s Jinbōchō used book district. They photographed them for a new self-published book called <a href=\"https://www.presentandcorrect.com/products/paper-trails-book\">Paper Trails</a>. \n\n        \n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/books\">books</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/design\">design</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Japan\">Japan</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/maps\">maps</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Paper%20Trails\">Paper Trails</a></p>\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/26/01/vintage-tourist-maps-of-japan\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"d68c53984f2b4346309b58b1ddf9d0cdb6b633428a9aac752cfbc71fffb00d7e","category":"Sites"}